(card "exp:E-R1-1_leader_ratio_bucket" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:E-R1-1_leader_ratio_bucket"
  :body "---\nnav: 35\ntype: experiment\nid: E-R1-1_leader_ratio_bucket\nshort_name: leader_ratio_bucket\ntitle: \"E-R1-1 — Anchor + drop (side,ratio_bucket) past 14d winrate < 0.40 (paused)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: e\nround: r1\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_e__leader_profile_paused]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.1882\ntrain_trade_count: 140\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8571\ntrain_sharpe: 7.698\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0601\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0675\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: paused\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [leader_profile, blacklist]\npast_only_window_days: 14\nwarmup_required: 5\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/e, round/r1, axis/leader_profile, axis/blacklist, status/paused, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# E-R1-1 — drop (side, ratio_bucket) past-14d winrate < 0.40\n\n> **TL;DR** —— Team E paused lineage 候选：基于 (side, ratio_bucket) 的 leader 历史 14d winrate 做 blacklist。 train NAV/sharpe/dd 完全等于 anchor —— **mechanism 实际为 NO-OP** (14d 窗口 + min_trades 5 + winrate threshold 0.40 在 anchor pool 上几乎触发不了 drop). lineage 整体被 pause, 作 anti-pattern reference 留下。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：(side, ratio_bucket) 维度上的 leader 历史 win-rate < 0.40 = \"结构性烂 setup\" → drop.\n- 实测：mechanism NO-OP (anchor 140 trade 没一个落到 winrate<0.40 bucket).\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- `team_e/scripts/round_1_runner.py`\n- 步骤：anchor base + drop legs where (side, ratio_bucket) past-14d winrate < 0.40, min_trades 5.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- past 14d strict past-only. min_trades 5 warmup. `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.1882 | 140 | 7.70 | 85.7% | -1.01% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0601 ± 0.068 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN (NO-OP, no gain expected) | - | - | - | - |\n\nbit-for-bit anchor = mechanism 在 train 期 never triggers.\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0; NO-OP.\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n- **same_lineage_NO-OP**: [[arc_260516a__team_e__E-R1-2__leader_ticker_rolling_q20]], [[arc_260516a__team_e__E-R1-3__leader_ticker_mean_ret_pos]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_e/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (E-R1-1)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **anti-pattern: too-strict mechanism + small pool = NO-OP**. Team E 三个 R1 候选都因 mechanism 几乎不触发而 bit-for-bit 等于 anchor.\n- 下次 leader-profile axis 必须先 audit \"raw trigger frequency\"。若 mechanism 在 anchor 期 trigger < 5% legs, 必须放宽阈值或扩窗口才有意义。\n- 这是 vault 里 `paused` status 唯一 example, 留作 \"NO-OP mechanism\" 反例.\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_e__E-R1-1__leader_ratio_bucket.md"
  :source_mtime "2026-05-17T10:32:08+08:00"
  :ingested_at "2026-05-21T01:29:42+08:00")

